  { "symbol": "_mfb_str_5", "kind": "constant", "layout": "mfb.string.v1 { u64 byteLength; u8 bytes[byteLength]; u8 nul }", "align": 8, "size": 344, "value": "The call depth exceeded the thread's stack. Raised at entry to the function that would have run past the thread's stack limit, before it binds anything; the caller's `TRAP` catches it and every frame unwound runs its cleanup, as for any failure. Distinct from `ErrOutOfMemory`: the arena may have room — the call chain is too deep." },
